      "side": 1,
      "message": "The in-tree hierarchy matches the permitted subclasses.\n\nCan we confirm external plugins are not supported in subclassing these public roots or leaves?\n\nBefore this change, a plugin could write:\n\n```\nclass CustomLabelPermission extends LabelPermission {\n  CustomLabelPermission() {\n    super(\"Code-Review\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSealing the roots and making the leaves final restricts that API. If leaf extensibility matters, permitted non-sealed leaves would preserve it.",
      "revId": "85146b7728aae19f36e52f1a190f714bf0a1e1b5",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
